<title>HONG KONG: Matrix year net returns to gain.</title>
<headline>Matrix year net returns to gain.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.41 gain    vs 10.60 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    10.76 profit vs 47.41 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     522.93	 vs 537.53</p>
<p>    Company name		 Matrix Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Matrix Holdings is a music box manufacturer.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year end to December 31 from August 31. Comparative figures are for 16 months ended December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
